Z||000000||BAM-BAM||07-13-2001||08:48 PM|||| I will be traveling to Cali tomorrow morning to pick JLRUIZ's 87GT. I bought it for my son that is in college to replace his S-10. He will be going with me and I think he's pretty jazzed. We will spend sometime, once we get back, getting him familiarized with the car. He has to report to camp the first of August so it will be a crash course (pun). Anyway, just thought I would share with the group. Afterall, eventually it will be mine, oh yes, it will be mine!!!!<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
